        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "...Off he goes."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Are you oka\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_092#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "What have you done! Oh, God, Talulah... Look at what you've done!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Talulah, we'll have to transport the village in two days. Just look at what you've...!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "You fought a patrolman! There'll be hell to pay now!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_092#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Letting him beat you was even less of an idea. It's getting late, and he's on the run. If I kill him now, we'll be long gone by the time the others find his remains."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "But that wouldn't solve any of our problems. Once the patrol unit regroups, they'd still come looking for us. They might well be out to get revenge on us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_092#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "And yet you did it! Now what do we do!?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_092#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Calm down. They're looking for Infected. They still don't know."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Don't know what?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "They don't know what I'm about to do."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Hey... Talulah!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "It's okay. Come on, I'll walk you back."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Your leg there... It will need special attention to heal."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Hah. So today's the day you start helping me walk? Always thought I was still in good shape myself. Who'd've guessed I couldn't outrun it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Talulah, there's something I need to tell you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "What is it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_092#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_092"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Ah, good question. Heh, hahah, sorry, I don't remember. Look at me now. Look at my memory..."
    },
